Sketch V0.8 for Psion 3a palmtops - FREEWARE

Sketch is a utility for making fast sketches and diagrams.
It implements "joystick-like" cursor control using the keys 
surrounding the L on the psion keyboard. It draws straight lines
or dots, and can load small .PIC files with symbols.
Installation is detailed in Readme.txt. Note: this program does
not work on the PC-3a Emulator.

Version 0.8 Adds the ability to enter lines of text.

